{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_125_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"二、夏，楚子、陳侯、鄭伯盟於夷陵。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"三、公孫歸父會齊人伐莒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"四、秋，晉侯會狄於欑函。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"不言及，外狄。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月，楚人殺陳夏徵舒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"此入而殺也，其不言入何也？外徵舒於陳也。其外徵舒於陳何也？明楚之討有罪也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"六、丁亥，楚子入陳。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"入者，內弗受也。日入，惡入者也。何用弗受也？不使夷狄為中國也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"七、納公孫寧、儀行父於陳。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_125_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_125","textTraditional":"納者，內弗受也。輔人之不能民而討，猶可；入人之國，制人之上下，使不得其君臣之道，不可。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}